要那么多钱又能干什么
if we inadvertently bring about Armageddon?

352
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:36,380
等等  你先打住
Okay, let me stop you right there.

353
00:14:36,380 --> 00:14:37,570
我们清楚知道自己的发明
We absolutely know our invention

354
00:14:37,570 --> 00:14:40,370
不会被用来毁灭世界
will not be used to destroy the world.

355
00:14:40,370 --> 00:14:41,460
怎么知道
How?

356
00:14:41,460 --> 00:14:43,170
因为没人从未来穿越回来
Because no one from the future

357
00:14:43,170 --> 00:14:45,760
追杀我们
has come back to kill us.

358
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,310
真好笑
Very funny.

359
00:14:48,310 --> 00:14:50,110
你有更好的想法吗
You got something better?

360
00:14:50,110 --> 00:14:51,160
并没有
Well, not really.

361
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,760
那不就得了
Okay, then.

362
00:14:58,180 --> 00:15:00,010
天啊  你喝了多少酒啊
Geez, how much wine did you drink?

363
00:15:00,010 --> 00:15:00,870
不多
Not a lot.

364
00:15:00,870 --> 00:15:04,090
只是你不走开  我尿不出来
I just couldn't start until you walked away.

365
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:10,260
地狱虾猛然冲出温泉
The Hell Prawn lunges out of the hot spring!

366
00:15:11,070 --> 00:15:13,030
你用盾牌将其抵挡
You block it with your shield.

367
00:15:13,030 --> 00:15:14,100
你要出击吗
Do you attack?

368
00:15:14,100 --> 00:15:15,210
它有眼睛吗
Does it have eyes?

369
00:15:15,210 --> 00:15:17,810
三只血红色巨眼  从来不眨一下
Three giant red ones and they never blink.

370
00:15:17,810 --> 00:15:19,330
看得人发毛
It's unsettling.

371
00:15:20,690 --> 00:15:22,620
我刺入中间那只眼
I stab it in the middle eye!

372
00:15:23,210 --> 00:15:24,080
明智之举
Good choice!

373
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:25,820
致命一击  你的剑
Critical hit! Your sword goes

374
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:27,850
刺穿它的眼睛  直插进它的小脑子
through its eye into its tiny brain.

375
00:15:27,850 --> 00:15:30,340
它奄奄一息地说
With its final dying gasp, it says,

376
00:15:30,340 --> 00:15:34,080
"你已经将我贬为一堆寿司
"You have reduced me to a pile of sushi.

377
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:38,130
配上这包酱油  好好享用我吧
Enjoy me with this packet of soy sauce.

378
00:15:38,370 --> 00:15:40,070
这是低钠酱油哦"
It's low sodium."

379
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:44,990
好的  我会把地狱虾吃掉
Okay, I guess I should eat the Hell Prawn.

380
00:15:44,990 --> 00:15:46,000
你用自己的剑
Using your sword,

381
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,950
做出了华丽的寿司大餐
you prepare a beautiful sushi dinner.

382
00:15:47,950 --> 00:15:51,090
你将身子浸入温泉  享受着温水
You slip into the hot spring and enjoy the warm water

383
00:15:51,090 --> 00:15:52,540
泡着你疼痛的关节
on your aching joints.

384
00:15:52,540 --> 00:15:54,330
你满足地闭上眼睛
As you happily close your eyes,

385
00:15:54,330 --> 00:15:56,590
回味着这不可思议的夜晚
you recall the incredible evening you've had

386
00:15:56,590 --> 00:15:58,530
并发现自己的...
and notice that your...

387
00:15:59,310 --> 00:16:03,390
脚和脚踝  比从前还要纤细
...feet and ankles are smaller than they've ever been.

388
00:16:03,690 --> 00:16:05,150
结束
The end.

389
00:16:05,590 --> 00:16:08,540
今晚比我预想的有趣多了
Wow, this night turned out to be so much more fun than I thought.

390
00:16:08,540 --> 00:16:10,250
欢乐尚未停歇
Oh, the fun doesn't stop.

391
00:16:10,250 --> 00:16:13,320
你还能带满满一包吐司回家呢
You're still going home with a goodie bag full of toast.

392
00:16:15,620 --> 00:16:17,480
谢谢你做的这些
Thank you for this.

393
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:20,250
自从大家发现我怀孕后
You know, ever since people found out I'm having a baby,

394
00:16:20,250 --> 00:16:22,970
都将我当成孕妇伯纳黛特看待
I feel like I became Pregnant Bernadette.

395
00:16:22,970 --> 00:16:25,530
今晚能暂时放下这包袱  真是太好了
It was nice to take a little break tonight.

396
00:16:25,530 --> 00:16:27,170
我能理解
I can understand that.

397
00:16:27,170 --> 00:16:29,430
自从大家发现我是个天才后
From the moment people realized I was a genius,

398
00:16:29,430 --> 00:16:31,760
我就一直被当作天才谢尔顿
I've been Sheldon the Genius.

399
00:16:32,810 --> 00:16:34,720
不过我从来没想过甩掉这包袱
Although I've never really wanted a break from that,

400
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:37,030
所以我大概也不理解
so I suppose I don't understand.

401
00:16:37,270 --> 00:16:38,400
这多讽刺
Which is ironic

402
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:41,150
毕竟我是个天才
'cause, you know, genius.

403
00:16:43,010 --> 00:16:44,300
再次谢谢你
Well, thanks again.

404
00:16:44,300 --> 00:16:45,350
不客气
You're welcome.

405
00:16:45,350 --> 00:16:48,170
你什么时候想摆脱孕妇伯纳黛特这包袱
And any time you need a break from being Bernadette the Pregnant,

406
00:16:48,170 --> 00:16:51,000
战士女皇博纳特克斯随时在此等候
Bernatrix the Warrior Queen is here waiting.

407
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,640
那我就恭敬不如从命了
I might just take you up on that.

408
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:53,800
提醒你哦
Well, mind you now,

409
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:56,220
此邀约仅在晚期妊娠前有效
that offer's only good until the third trimester.

410
00:16:56,220 --> 00:16:59,840
我不能冒着我的专座被羊水沾到的风险
I can't risk getting amniotic fluid on my spot.

411
00:17:02,450 --> 00:17:05,610
哥们  你在破坏我和克莱尔的关系
Hey, dude, you're killing me with Claire.

412
00:17:05,610 --> 00:17:06,930
这话什么意思
What are you talking about?

413
00:17:06,930 --> 00:17:09,330
我是说  瞧瞧你
I mean, come on, look at you.

414
00:17:09,330 --> 00:17:10,690
典型美男子
You're classically handsome,

415
00:17:10,690 --> 00:17:12,350
还拥有游泳健将的身材
you've got a swimmer's body.

416
00:17:12,350 --> 00:17:15,400
在你身旁  我就被打回原形了
Next to you, I look like me.

417
00:17:16,130 --> 00:17:18,170
兄弟  我不是故意的
Oh, man, I didn't mean to do that.

418
00:17:18,570 --> 00:17:22,080
不过谢谢你看出了我游泳健将的身材
But I do appreciate you recognizing my swimmer's body.

419
00:17:22,730 --> 00:17:23,750
这是个意外
Which, incidentally,

420
00:17:23,750 --> 00:17:27,260
马可波罗是一个在泳池玩的捉迷藏游戏
一个人当鬼蒙上眼睛去抓其他人

421
00:17:23,750 --> 00:17:27,260
我在基督青年会玩"马可波罗"游戏练出来的
I got from playing Marco Polo at the YMCA.

422
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:31,620
好吧  帮我个忙
Yeah, okay, just... do me a favor

423
00:17:31,620 --> 00:17:34,960
不要再说克莱尔多棒多好了
and stop talking about how great Claire is.

424
00:17:35,290 --> 00:17:38,020
乐意效劳  我的外国小友人
Anything for you, my little foreign friend.

425
00:17:38,910 --> 00:17:40,310
我得问一句
So, I got to ask,

426
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:42,940
拉杰会带别的姑娘跟你们玩吗
does Raj bring around other girls?

427
00:17:43,710 --> 00:17:44,940
这个嘛
Uh, you know,

428
00:17:44,940 --> 00:17:46,870
我不经常跟他们一起玩
I-I'm not really around that much.

429
00:17:46,870 --> 00:17:49,040
这事艾米比我可清楚多了
Amy knows much more than I do.

430
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:51,820
我觉得你没什么可担心的
I don't think you have anything to worry about.

431
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:54,840
拉杰人很好  过分忠诚
Raj is a terrific guy, loyal to a fault.

432
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:57,830
对啊  他还没丢掉美国在线的邮箱呢
Yeah. He still has an AOL address.

433
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:57,830
美国比较早期的因特网服务提供商

434
00:17:59,170 --> 00:18:01,080
我懂你的意思
I see what you're saying.

435
00:18:01,500 --> 00:18:03,760
她也没有多好嘛
She's not so great.

436
00:18:08,670 --> 00:18:09,580
别听他的
Don't listen to him.

437
00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:11,320
他总说傻话
He says crazy things all the time.

438
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,290
不信你看  马可
Uh, watch. Marco.

439
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:15,170
游戏中鬼会先喊"马克"  躲起来的人就回"波罗"
让鬼由声音来判断其他人躲在哪里

440
00:18:12,290 --> 00:18:15,170
波罗
Polo!

441
00:18:16,420 --> 00:18:19,530
你们在聊什么呢
So, uh, what are you guys talking about?

442
00:18:19,530 --> 00:18:21,300
你朋友们正跟我讲
Your friends were just telling me about

443
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:23,700
你约会的其他姑娘的事儿呢
all the other girls you're dating.

444
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:25,080
你们干嘛要这样
Why would you do that?

445
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:27,750
我特地嘱咐过你们不要说
I specifically asked you not to do that.

446
00:18:27,750 --> 00:18:28,970
我们没说
We didn't.

447
00:18:28,970 --> 00:18:31,380
你刚自己说了
You just did.

448
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:36,220
看来你们没一个智商超群
Maybe none of you guys are smart.

449
00:18:44,780 --> 00:18:45,600
早
Morning.

450
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:47,120
早
Morning.

451
00:18:47,120 --> 00:18:49,450
酒喝太多了
Ugh. Too much wine.

452
00:18:49,450 --> 00:18:51,800
我昨晚也是吃太多了
Oh, I overdid it myself last night.

453
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:55,440
我也要来片回魂吐司
Hair of the dog.

454
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:55,440
宿醉时靠再喝酒缓解痛苦的方法
又被称为喝"回魂酒"

455
00:18:55,450 --> 00:18:58,090
你有没有想过我们的导向系统
Hey, did you ever think about the military applications

456
00:18:58,090 --> 00:18:59,710
被用到军事用途上
for the guidance system?

457
00:18:59,710 --> 00:19:01,170
当然了
Of course.

458
00:19:01,490 --> 00:19:03,270
你心里不会不舒服吗
Does it bother you?

459
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:05,430
不啊  虽然一开始会
No, it did at first,

460
00:19:05,430 --> 00:19:09,010
然后我跟法兰克与艾丽西娅聊过以后
but then I talked it through with Frank and Alicia, and...

461
00:19:11,730 --> 00:19:14,770
他们真的让我换个新角度看待这件事
...they really helped put things into perspective.

462
00:19:14,770 --> 00:19:17,310
这俩人是谁啊
Who are these people?

463
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:22,190
莱纳德  朋友就像厕纸
Leonard, friends are like toilet paper.

464
00:19:22,930 --> 00:19:25,970
洗手台下面多备着几卷准没错
It's good to have extras under the sink.

